                                "sense_id": "a381f911-769a-340b-8d64-b2ffa8d8d54a",
                                "text": "He turned the pages slowly, moving on to other metropolitan catastrophes, the next mithridatic outrage, the pages fluttered behind the front page but the headline remained the same, in the same place hovering across from her."
